# Softlock probe — f3 R2 "The Gap" (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN M5).
#
# The trench crate is the only way north. Shove it somewhere useless, walk out, walk back in,
# and the room still solves: a pushable crate that was not consumed is rebuilt where the map
# put it on every entry (01 §9).

floor f3
room R2
at 6,5
start hp=6 treasure=0 deaths=0

assert room=R2 treasure=0

say Jam attempt: three shoves east, off the lane that reaches the trench
goto 5,4
push R 3

say Out through the south door and straight back in
door d1
door d1
assert room=R2 treasure=0

say The crate is back on (6,4), and the trench takes it as it always did
goto 6,5
push U 2
goto 6,3
collect 4,1 3,1
assert room=R2 treasure=2

say And the way north is open
door d2
assert room=R3 treasure=2
